oncentrated W8 and W9 tiles which can form pungs, while keeping W7 allows for potential chows. This maximizes my chances of completing a winning hand worth at least 8 points through patterns like \"All Pungs\" (6 points) combined with other scoring patterns.\n\nAnswer: Play T7"}
