n be organized as [W7-W8-W9] Chow + [W8-W8-W8] Pung + [W9-W9] Pair. Combined with my existing melds [F2-F2-F2] and [T4-T5-T6], this forms a valid 4-meld + 1-pair winning hand. T5 is isolated and prevents me from achieving this winning formation.\n\nAnswer: Play T5"}
